      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The system was purchased through Solar Storage Solutions and installed by TAB Electrical. The system was promptly installed after the payment of a 10% deposit. Installation was incomplete due to the absence of an aerial to link the inverter to our WiFi.  Consequently, the performance of the system was not monitored for around a month.  When the aerial was finally supplied and fitted I was able to monitor its performance online.  I soon realised that the inverter was only picking up 11 of the 22 panels.  The salesman's spiel crowed that their monitoring would detect any fault with the system. This didn't happen. I brought the issue to the attention of TAB Electrical and the installing electrician came and corrected the issue the next day.  Very satisfied with their performance.  Solar Storage Solutions then invoiced me for the balance of the purchase.  I expressed my displeasure with them ie their monitoring failed and they had not given me a handover/induction to date. The owner has apologised for \"dropping the ball\" on monitoring and said he would get the salesman to contact me regarding a handover.  At the time of writing no contact has been made.  I understand the saleman is in the process of moving and has health and family issues.  In short I think Solar Storage Solutions administration has been sloppy.  I'm not chasing them to complete the handover and I am not paying the balance of the purchase price until they do.",
